[0.000, "o", "opose)* - propose a change as a ManifestWork. Applies nothing.\r\n../README.md:393:  - `name` (string) - short kebab-case ManifestWork name.\r\n../README.md:396:- **`apply_manifestwork`** *(apply)* - deliver an approved ManifestWork.\r\n../README.md:398:- **`propose_rollback`** *(propose)* - propose undoing an applied ManifestWork; creates a rollback proposal bound to its UID.\r\n../README.md:399:  - `proposal_id` (string) - the applied ManifestWork proposal to undo.\r\n../README.md:400:- **`rollback_manifestwork`** *(apply)* - delete the ManifestWork after the rollback is approved (needs a rollback-scoped token).\r\n../README.md:449:  - `resource` (string) - e.g. `managedclusters`, `placements`, `manifestworks`, `managedclusteraddons`, `klusterlets`.\r\n../README.md:459:- **`list_pending_proposals`** *(read)* - ManifestWorks and cluster actions awaiting approval.\r\n../README.md:474:| **`why_not_scheduled`** | explain why a cluster was or was not selected by a Placement, from the live objects | `cluster`, `placement`, `name"]
