[0.000, "o", " trail is readable as evidence: tools **return normally** when they refuse, so a naive wrapper would log the privileged-nginx attempt as `ok`. Parsing the `REJECTED`/`FAILED`/`ERROR` prefix out of the return string is what keeps seq 9 and 11 from becoming false successes — and the docstring says explicitly that the eval harness scores from this log.\r\r\n356:# done - fleet left running; tear down with ./hack/teardown.sh\r\r\n\r\n"]
