[0.000, "o", "day with <b>Claude</b>, live from a cold start: install from PyPI, <code>claude mcp add</code>, inventory the fleet, reason about placement — then ship a new service the gated way: the privileged <code>:latest</code> shortcut is <b>refused</b>, the pinned proposal is <b>signed by a human</b>, applied with the token, verified, and the whole day is read back <b>from the audit trail</b>. — <a href=\\\"demo/connect-claude.mp4\\\">narrated MP4</a> · <a href=\\\"demo/connect-claude.cast\\\">terminal cast</a>.</sub>\\r\\n../README.md:125:        \\\"OCM_MCP_SPOKE_CONTEXTS\\\": \\\"cluster1=kind-cluster1,cluster2=kind-cluster2,cluster3=kind-cluster3\\\"\\r\\n../README.md:144:        \\\"OCM_MCP_SPOKE_CONTEXTS\\\"\r\n6120:1015:[0.000, \"o\", \"opose)* - propose a change as a ManifestWork. Applies nothing.\\r\\n../README.md:393:  - `name` (string) - short kebab-case ManifestWork name.\\r\\n../README.md:396:- **`apply_manifestwork`** *(apply)* - deliver an approved ManifestWork.\\r\\n../README.md:398:- **`propose_rollback`** *(propose)* - propose un"]
